            "mimeType": "text/css",
            "text": ".div-posee-cc {\r\n    margin-right: 52px;\r\n    width: 11%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n#bar-banner {\r\n    position: unset !important;\r\n    background-image: unset !important;\r\n    background-color: white;\r\n}\r\n\r\n#progress-bar-banner {\r\n    height: 2px;\r\n    background-color: rgb(61 91 121);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.barra-rosa {\r\n    background-color: #ff436e !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 879px) {\r\n    .div-posee-cc {\r\n        display: none;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .posee-cc-menu {\r\n        margin-top: 10px;\r\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n        margin-left: 28%;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    #progess-bar-menu {\r\n        height: 2px;\r\n        background-color: none !important;\r\n        background-color: rgb(178 172 243);\r\n        width: 64%;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .div-credito {\r\n        text-align: left;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    #bar-menu {\r\n        background-color: rgba(var(--bs-link-color-rgb));\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .credito-bar {\r\n        text-align: left\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (min-width: 879px) {\r\n    .posee-cc-menu {\r\n        display: none;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n"
